  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In resonance $Z=R$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{I}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{R}} \\\\ & \\mathrm{R} \\rightarrow \\text { halved } \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{I} \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{I}\\end{aligned}$\nI becomes doubled.",
